{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","title":"componentIndex","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"componentIndex"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"}],"roleHeading":"Type Property","extendedModule":"FirebladeECS","externalID":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentPAAE14componentIndexSivpZ","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component\/componentIndex-5oxlf","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component"]]},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"componentIndex","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Storages address their per-type state and the per-entity component bitset by this value."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default implementation assigns indices lazily: the first access of a type takes the next free index"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the process, later accesses look it up in a thread-safe table. The index is process-wide, not per ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so all nexuses of a process agree on it. Indices are dense ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0 ..< n"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"n"},{"type":"text","text":" types used so far) and unbounded."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"They depend on the order of first use and are not stable between process launches;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/stableIdentifier"},{"type":"text","text":" for persistent data."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift has no stored static properties in generic types, so a plain conformance can not cache its index in a static."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provide your own implementation (the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Component"},{"type":"text","text":" macro will) as a stored "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"static let"},{"text":" for a plain load,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"but only if you can guarantee that two types never share an index and that it is in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0 ..< 1_048_576"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Indices are process-wide: a hand-assigned index must not collide with a lazily assigned one of another type."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"A collision or an index out of range traps at first use of the type in a nexus.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Complexity","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(1)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The dense index of this component type."}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/component\/componentindex-5oxlf"]}],"references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","title":"FirebladeECS","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A lightweight, fast and easy to use Entity-Component System in Swift."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Nexus":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","abstract":[],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Nexus"}],"url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/nexus","title":"Nexus","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Nexus"}]},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/RegistrableComponent/stableIdentifier":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/stableIdentifier","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stableIdentifier","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS25StableComponentIdentifierV","text":"StableComponentIdentifier","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The stable identifier of this component type, derived from "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/componentTypeName"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/registrablecomponent\/stableidentifier","title":"stableIdentifier"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/RegistrableComponent/componentTypeName":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/componentTypeName","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"tex